":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-05-20","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"FL"},{"bioguideId":"G000605","fullName":"Rep. Gray, Adam [D-CA-13]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"D","sponsorshipDate":"2025-06-12","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"CA"},{"bioguideId":"C001120","fullName":"Rep. Crenshaw, Dan [R-TX-2]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-06-12","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"TX"},{"bioguideId":"B001327","fullName":"Rep. Bresnahan, Robert P. [R-PA-8]","isOriginalCosponsor":false,"party":"R","sponsorshipDate":"2025-09-30","sponsorshipWithdrawnDate":null,"state":"PA"}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T19:28:28+00:00","id":"hr946-119","introducedDate":"2025-02-04","latestAction":{"actionDate":"2025-02-06","text":"Sponsor introductory remarks on measure. (CR H535-536)"},"laws":[],"number":"946","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Health","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"J000302","district":13,"fullName":"Rep. Joyce, John [R-PA-13]","party":"R","state":"PA"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2025-02-04","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Optimizing Research Progress Hope And New Cures Act or the ORPHAN Cures Act</strong></p><p>This bill modifies certain provisions under the Medicare Drug Price Negotiation Program with respect to orphan drugs.</p><p>The Medicare Drug Price Negotiation Program requires the Centers for Medicare &amp; Medicaid Services to negotiate the prices of certain prescription drugs under Medicare beginning in 2026. Among other requirements, drugs must have had market approval for at least 7 years (for drug products) or 11 years (for biologics) to qualify for negotiation. The program does not apply to orphan drugs that are approved to treat only one rare disease or condition.</p><p>The bill modifies these provisions so as to exclude any period in which a drug was an orphan drug from market approval calculations. It also excludes orphan drugs that are approved to treat more than one rare disease or condition from the program.</p>","updateDate":"2025-05-08T19:40:40Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"ORPHAN Cures Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2025-12-05T22:02:15Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2025-12-05T22:02:15Z"}
